  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/adro/Decision_NADP_SR_389_2024">
    <adro:raisesGround rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/adro/Ground_NotIntentional"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Ground raised and not established: the Appellant failed to discharge the burden of establishing on the balance of probability that his ADRVs were not intentional within the meaning of ADR Article 10.2.3.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The appeal tribunal confirmed the violations and the period of ineligibility.</rdfs:comment>
