    <adro:establishes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/adro/Ineligibility_AAA_30_190_00170_07"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The period of ineligibility runs from a date thirty days after the sample was taken, and the panel treated an earlier finding as a first violation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The award as published states no date of issue, so none is asserted.</rdfs:comment>
