    <obo:BFO_0000176 rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/adro/UKADRules_2021"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The provision states that the standard sets out the circumstances in which Athletes may be granted permission to Use, for therapeutic purposes, substances or methods on the Prohibited List the Use of which would otherwise be prohibited.</rdfs:comment>
