    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">As stated in National Anti-Doping Panel (United Kingdom) SR/056/2022: On 5 January 2022 a UKAD Doping Control Officer attended the Hunslet RLFC ground in order to carry out testing. Mr Kaye was selected to take a urine test. He completed the Doping Control Form and provided a urine Sample.</rdfs:comment>
